sequenceDiagram
  participant E as Hospital EHR / stream
  participant L as Local Monitoring Agent
  participant P as Policy + quality gate
  participant M as Local model runtime
  participant C as Clinician
  participant G as Global Monitoring Agent

  E->>L: New vitals, labs, medications, encounter state
  L->>L: Validate, profile, derive approved features
  L->>P: Request model execution with scope and version
  P-->>L: Permit, narrow, or deny with reason
  alt permitted
    L->>M: Score locally
    M-->>L: Risk, uncertainty, explanation inputs
    L->>C: Decision-support alert with evidence
    C-->>L: Acknowledge, defer, or act
    L->>G: De-identified run summary and metrics
  else denied or low quality
    L->>L: Suppress action and record audit event
    L->>G: Operational exception without patient identifiers
  end
  G->>G: Compare sites, detect drift, plan updates
  G-->>L: Approved signed model / policy bundle
